# =============================================================================
# GitHub CORE scope (2026-10-31, user quote)
# IN:  code, DEPLOY, EasyVtuberStudio.exe, example character (bai), seed memory,
#      pip lists, docs, packaging scripts.
# OUT: runtime / Python / torch, add-on packs, THA3/THA4 teacher weights,
#      local workspace, experiment dumps, secrets, CodeGraph, history.
# HF ark (not this repo): THA3 weights, teacher zip (exe+src+5.pt+pose, no
#      Python/torch), OSF Binary/models, ONNX extras, low-heat public copies.
# =============================================================================

